```pseudocode
function countUpToThree():
    // Initialize the counter
    counter = 0

    // Loop until the counter reaches 3
    while counter < 3:
        // Print the current value of the counter
        print(counter)

        // Increment the counter
        counter = counter + 1

    // End of the loop
    print("Counting is done up to 3.")
```

